  {
    "id": "c088",
    "name": "Schedule I Novi Office Risk Assessment",
    "text": "Employee does not believe that the closure of Ajuba’s Novi, MI office will adversely 1 impact | Ajuba’s ability to retain or perform services for its U.S.-based clients, assuming that all systems located at, and functions performed by, Ajuba’s Novi, MI office are relocated to, and handled in a manner consistent with Ajuba’s past practices by, other Ajuba or MiraMed facilities,"
  },
